             Version 1.21 Comprehensive Update Patch

                          March 6, 1995
    
    This file will update any version of Strategic Falcon to 
    version 1.21.
    
    To apply the patch, copy the files DONTRUN.EXE, SF_ALL.RTP,
    VERTAD.DAT, and STRATPAT.EXE into your Strategic Falcon 
    directory (normally "\STRAT"). Or copy the self-extracting 
    archive "SFALL.EXE" into your Strategic Falcon directory and 
    type "SFALL" <Enter>.
     
    When you've got the update files in the proper place, type 
    "STRATPAT" <Enter>.
    
    Next, please read the documentation files NEW!.TXT, 
    11_READ.ME, 111_READ.ME, 12_READ.ME, and 121_READ.ME. (There 
    have been quite a few changes to StratFalc!)
    
    If you're trying to install Strategic FALCON version 1.0 
    to use with FALCONCD.EXE, please read the instructions at 
    the end of this file.
    
    If you have any questions, you can reach me by one of the 
    methods detailed in the documentation.  (Oh, and feel free 
    to upload this patch file to any BBS you feel would benefit 
    from it!)
    
