    The StratFalc ver 1.0 install program looks for the file 
    FALCON3.EXE on your hard drive so it can create essential 
    backups of some of your Falcon 3.0 data files.
    
    If you use the FALCON GOLD CD-ROM to install Falcon, there 
    will be no FALCON3.EXE file on your hard disk. Take the 
    following steps *before* attempting to install Strategic 
    FALCON:
    
    *  Install Falcon GOLD in accordance with Spectrum Holobyte's 
       instructions. You can use either the full hard drive 
       installation or the CD-ROM installation. After the 
       installation is complete, you should return to a DOS 
       prompt.
       
    *  If you used the CD-ROM installation, copy the following 
       files from the \F3CD directory of your CD to the 
       \FALCONCD directory on your hard drive:
    
                            ILS.BOS
                            ILS.HOK 
                            ILS.IRQ 
                            ILS.ISR 
                            ILS.KOR 
                            ILS.NEL 
                            ILS.PAK 
                            ILS.PAN 
                           BOSNIA.STR 
                           INDIA.STR 
                           ISRAEL.STR
                           JAPAN.STR 
                           KOREA.STR 
                           KUWAIT.STR 
                           NELLIS.STR 
                           PANAMA.STR
                          SQDNAMES.STR
                (In other words, ILS.* and *.STR)
                                   
    *  For example, if you CD-ROM drive is E:, and your hard 
       drive is C:, you'd type:
   
         COPY E:\F3CD\ILS.* C:\FALCONCD  (Press <Enter>)
         COPY E:\F3CD\*.STR C:\FALCONCD  (Press <Enter>)

    *  If you're not there already, change to the \FALCONCD 
       directory on your hard drive:
      
         C:  (Press <Enter>)
         CD \FALCONCD  (Press <Enter>)
    
    *  Next, rename FALCONCD.EXE to FALCON3.EXE:
                                               
         REN FALCONCD.EXE FALCON3.EXE  (Press <Enter>)
                                   
    *  Install Strategic FALCON from its distribution diskette.
       Apply this patch to your new Strategic FALCON 
       installation using the instructions given at the top of 
       this file.
      
    *  Finally, rename your FALCON3.EXE back to FALCONCD.EXE:
      
         REN FALCON3.EXE FALCONCD.EXE  (Press <Enter>)      
 
